Selected-key QSA prefill and short-query kernels adapted from the MIT-licensed
halo-box/strix-llama.cpp snapshot 7a9196dad8b13b70fb3420886aadaf98fc09b849.
https://github.com/halo-box/strix-llama.cpp/commit/7a9196dad8b13b70fb3420886aadaf98fc09b849

Paracetamol restricts HIP dispatch to gfx1151 and the tested Qwen4exp F16
geometry, keeps the ordinary mask authoritative, and attaches selected-key
IDs only when PARACETAMOL_QWEN4EXP_QSA_KERNEL=1. Other models and backends
retain their existing attention path. CPU-reference operator tests cover
prefill, poisoned masked cells, and short-query decode, including duplicate
IDs and FP64 oracle comparisons.

